import ../../../examples/games/geometry_dash/controls.dl

set session to a new route session
set interface to an instance of geometry dash with state (the address of session)
set view to a new UI view
set view's instance to the address of interface
set view's keys to a new boolean array of 512 items
set view's input kind to 3
set view's key press to the UI space key
read route input from the address of view
require condition (session's phase = 1) reporting "Space did not start the route"
require condition (view's key press = -1) reporting "Jump input leaked into UI activation"
set view's frame seconds to the dash tick / 2.0
advance the route frame in the address of view
require condition (session's tick = 0) reporting "A partial frame advanced the physics"
require condition (session's jump requested) reporting "A short jump was lost before a physics tick"
advance the route frame in the address of view
require condition (session's player's jumps = 1) reporting "A queued press/release did not jump"
require condition (not session's jump requested) reporting "The simulation did not consume the jump"
set view's input kind to 3
set view's key press to 258
read route input from the address of view
require condition (view's key press = 258) reporting "Game input consumed Tab navigation"
set view's input kind to 9
set view's key press to the UI space key
read route input from the address of view
require condition (view's key press = -1) reporting "Jump repeat leaked into UI activation"
set view's damaged to false
set view's input kind to 3
set view's key press to the UI P key
read route input from the address of view
require condition (view's damaged) reporting "A game shortcut did not invalidate the view"
set tick to session's tick
advance the route frame in the address of view
require condition (session's tick = tick) reporting "Paused input advanced the route"
set view's key press to the UI space key
read route input from the address of view
require condition (not session's jump requested) reporting "A paused tap was queued for after resume"
close the address of interface
close the address of session
print line "Game input passed"
